{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_12_research_phase2_search", "label": "Research pipeline \u2014 Phase 2: the search \u2014 Implementation Plan", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_12_research_phase2_search", "label": "Research Pipeline Phase 2: the Search \u2014 Implementation Plan", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Phase 2 produces a ranked, ablated, ledgered list of candidates on a discovery slice only. Nothing is admitted: held-out gates, the error budget and the handoff into _mechanism_once are phase 3."}, {"id": "trader_research_evaluate", "label": "trader/research/evaluate.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "trader_research_evaluate_evaluate", "label": "evaluate()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three numbers, because one is never enough: the cross-symbol spread of rotation-null percentiles, compounded return over one account at the live cap, and whether the rule fires often enough to be judged at all."}, {"id": "trader_research_evaluate_load_bundle", "label": "load_bundle()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A DataFeed built for research reads must never construct a ccxt client; NoExchange is the ONE definition and an accidental use raises instead of quietly fetching."}, {"id": "trader_research_evaluate_bundle", "label": "Bundle (dataclass)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Everything one horizon's evaluations need, already truncated at the discovery cut."}, {"id": "trader_research_growth", "label": "trader/research/growth.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every filter tried on the book held its profit factor and halved compounded return: the trades they cut were near break-even individually and carried a disproportionate share of the fat right tail."}, {"id": "trader_research_growth_decide", "label": "decide()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A survivor must beat every one-part ablation, not merely the parent it grew from \u2014 the ablation is what shows which parts actually carry the edge."}, {"id": "trader_research_growth_earns_place", "label": "earns_place()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A part must improve BOTH the rotation null AND compounded return over one account; neither alone is evidence of anything."}, {"id": "trader_research_growth_carries_information", "label": "carries_information()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Above GROW_MAX_P a rule is not distinguishable enough from its own rotation to be worth spending the search's time extending. Deliberately loose: a piece may be useless alone and valuable in company."}, {"id": "trader_research_growth_ablation", "label": "ablation()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "trader_research_control", "label": "trader/research/control.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A gate that cannot see the incumbent inside a window cannot refute a challenger inside it. The control runs on the incumbent's DECLARED 16, because on the discovery universe the incumbent itself is measured as no-edge."}, {"id": "trader_research_control_control_combo", "label": "control_combo()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The channel is DURATION-matched per horizon (100 bars at 4h is ~17 days), because a 100-bar channel at 15m is a different mechanism, not the same one measured faster."}, {"id": "trader_research_control_incumbent_universe", "label": "incumbent_universe()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A truncated universe reads as a weaker incumbent rather than as a smaller sample, and a control that can never read as powered would label every window UNDERPOWERED."}, {"id": "trader_research_control_powered", "label": "powered()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "trader_research_control_label", "label": "label()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A rule that does not register in a window where the known-good rule also cannot register is UNDERPOWERED, never no_edge."}, {"id": "trader_research_control_mask_part", "label": "mask_part()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The comparison is always true where the series is present and NaN \u2014 therefore False \u2014 where it is not, so the conjunction simply cannot fire outside the window."}, {"id": "trader_research_ledger", "label": "trader/research/ledger.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every combination it ever evaluated is recorded under its canonical hash, kept or not, so a restart resumes, the same set reached by two growth paths counts as ONE look, and no negative is recorded without its ablation and its window's control."}, {"id": "trader_research_ledger_ledger", "label": "Ledger (class)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Written through Journal._tx(), NEVER through Journal.query(): that runs on a thread-local connection with no transaction wrapper, so an INSERT through it stays uncommitted \u2014 how an unvalidated strategy got into the book on 2026-09-11."}, {"id": "trader_research_planner", "label": "trader/research/planner.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The order is forced: measure, control, singles, ablation, grow, seeded. Held-out results never enter this file \u2014 if a held-out failure steered the next round, held-out data would silently become discovery data."}, {"id": "trader_research_planner_next_batch", "label": "next_batch()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Control gating is PER WINDOW, not per horizon; gating globally would stall every horizon behind its slowest window. This module is the ONLY gatekeeper \u2014 evaluate.py and growth.py never look at a control."}, {"id": "trader_research_planner_seed_parts", "label": "seed_parts()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "'Donchian + X, judged with and without' is the one search the book can run against a mechanism it already believes in."}, {"id": "trader_research_planner_needs_ablation", "label": "needs_ablation()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "trader_research_planner_batch", "label": "Batch (dataclass)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "trader_research_job", "label": "trader/research/job.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The child READS the stores and returns results; it never writes a database, so the kernel thread remains the only writer of truth."}, {"id": "trader_research_job_measure_job", "label": "measure_job()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A threshold is measured on a quantity that would evaluate to NaN when actually used, so each FeatureCtx carries the same context an evaluation gets."}, {"id": "trader_research_job_evaluate_job", "label": "evaluate_job()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A failure is a LOOK with a reason, never a deferral: routing it to `skipped` would make the planner re-offer it forever and one poisonous rule would stall its window."}, {"id": "trader_research_runner", "label": "trader/research/runner.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The kernel thread owns the schedule and every write; the child owns the arithmetic. The search stands down when the last trade cycle ran long \u2014 the trade loop wins, always."}, {"id": "trader_research_runner_researchrunner", "label": "ResearchRunner (class)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Handles the three failures the spec names in the runner rather than the child, because the child may not survive them: timeout, crash, and CPU contention."}, {"id": "trader_research_main", "label": "trader/research/__main__.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "--once and --measure run the batch in THIS process's child, ignoring research.enabled, so a horizon can be calibrated and timed before the kernel is allowed to spend hours on it."}, {"id": "trader_kernel", "label": "trader/kernel.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "trader_kernel_research_loop", "label": "Kernel._research_loop()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The kernel's pandas work holds the GIL, so the arithmetic runs in a spawned child at nice 19 rather than on a thread that would slow the trade loop directly."}, {"id": "config", "label": "config.yaml", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A horizon that falls short of 16 discovery symbols is refused, not relaxed \u2014 an unreachable gate is not a horizon, it is a way to spend two cores on nothing."}, {"id": "concept_underpowered_label", "label": "UNDERPOWERED label", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A negative in a window where the known-good rule also cannot register is a statement about the window's power, not about the market."}, {"id": "concept_discovery_slice", "label": "Discovery slice (calendar cut)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One CALENDAR cut per horizon at 70% of the universe's span: per-symbol splits leak era across symbols, so a market listed in 2023 would have its discovery slice inside BTC's held-out era."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_12_research_phase2_search", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_11_luffy_research_pipeline_design", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_12_research_phase2_search", "target": "trader_research_main", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_12_research_phase2_search", "target": "trader_kernel_research_loop", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_12_research_phase2_search", "target": "config", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "trader_research_evaluate_load_bundle", "target": "trader_research_evaluate_bundle", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "trader_research_evaluate_evaluate", "target": "trader_research_evaluate_bundle", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "trader_research_growth_decide", "target": "trader_research_growth_earns_place", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "trader_research_growth_decide", "target": "trader_research_growth_carries_information", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "trader_research_growth_decide", "target": "trader_research_growth_ablation", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "trader_research_control_control_combo", "target": "trader_research_control_mask_part", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "trader_research_control_incumbent_universe", "target": "trader_research_control_control_combo", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "trader_research_planner_next_batch", "target": "trader_research_control_control_combo", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "trader_research_planner_next_batch", "target": "trader_research_planner_needs_ablation", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "trader_research_planner_next_batch", "target": "trader_research_planner_seed_parts", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "trader_research_planner_next_batch", "target": "trader_research_planner_batch", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "trader_research_planner_next_batch", "target": "trader_research_ledger_ledger", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-research-phase2-search.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "trader_research_job_measure_job", "target": "trader_research_evaluate_load_bundle", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "c